      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VC deal flow enrichment\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nWhen a deal enters the CRM, four research calls run side by side: company data, recent news, competitors and filings.\n\nClaude writes a structured deal memo from the merged research, a scoring step checks it against the fund's thesis, and the memo is written to a Google Doc.\n\nThe CRM record gets the score and the memo link, and the deal team sees it in Slack.",
